:: Danny Room [danny]
<<if C.npc.Danny is undefined>>
  <<newNamedNpc {nam: "Danny", title: "dependent", insecurity: "weak", teen: 1, adult: 0, type: "human", pronoun: "f", gender: "f"}>>
<</if>>
You enter Danny's room. <<npc "Danny">> looks up.
<<if $dannyIntro isnot 1>>
  <<set $dannyIntro to 1>>
  "H-hey... I'm Danny. I live here too. I have a weak bladder. Please don't tell Bailey."
  <<love "Danny" 5>>
<</if>>
<<link [[Talk|Danny Room]]>><<love "Danny" 2>><</link>>
<<link [[Help with control training|Danny Room]]>><<set $danny.control += 5>><<love "Danny" 3>><</link>>
<<link [[Offer dependency care|Danny Room]]>><<set $danny.dependency += 5>><<love "Danny" 4>><</link>>
<<link [[Leave|Bedroom]]>><</link>>

:: Danny First Meeting Canteen [danny]
In the canteen Danny nearly bumps into you.
"S-sorry! I'm Danny. We both live at the orphanage, right?"
<<link [[Continue|School Canteen]]>><<set $dannyIntro to 1>><</link>>

